<%- include('partials/header') %>

<%- include("partials/breadcrumbs", {breadcrumbs: [{label:'Home',url:'/'},{label:'Symptoms Guide'}]}) %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image:url('<%= site.symptomsHeroImage %>')"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Car Symptoms Guide — What's Wrong With My Car?</h1>
    <p>Noticing something unusual with your vehicle? Browse our symptom guide to understand what might be happening, and contact us for a free diagnosis.</p>
    <div class="hero-buttons">
      <a href="tel:<%= site.phoneTel %>" class="btn btn-primary">Call <%= site.phone %></a>
      <a href="sms:<%= site.phoneSms %>" class="btn btn-secondary">Text Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <% var categories = [...new Set(allSymptoms.map(s => s.category))]; %>
    <% categories.forEach(cat => { %>
    <div class="symptom-category">
      <h2><%= cat %> Symptoms</h2>
      <div class="symptoms-grid">
        <% allSymptoms.filter(s => s.category === cat).forEach(sy => { %>
        <a href="/symptoms/<%= sy.slug %>" class="symptom-card cat-<%= sy.category.toLowerCase().replace(' ','') %>">
          <span class="symptom-cat-chip"><%= sy.category %></span>
          <h3><%= sy.name %></h3>
          <span class="card-link">Learn More</span>
        </a>
        <% }) %>
      </div>
    </div>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section bg-light">
  <div class="container content-narrow">
    <h2>What Happens When You Bring In a Symptom?</h2>
    <p>You describe what you're hearing, feeling, or seeing — we take it from there. Scott handles most initial diagnoses himself. He'll drive the vehicle when needed, put it on the lift, and give you a straight explanation of what's going on and what it will cost to fix.</p>
    <p>We don't charge just to look at your car. If the diagnostic work requires real time and equipment — for example, tracing an intermittent electrical fault — we'll tell you upfront what that will cost before we start.</p>
    <h2>Use This Guide as a Starting Point</h2>
    <p>Each symptom page on this site explains common causes and what kind of repair may be involved. They're meant to help you arrive informed, not to replace a hands-on inspection. Two vehicles with the same symptom can have completely different root causes — which is exactly why we look at each car on its own terms.</p>
    <h2>When to Come In Right Away</h2>
    <p>Some symptoms can wait a few days; others shouldn't. If you notice a burning smell, a sudden loss of braking power, a temperature warning light, or any fluid leak, bring your vehicle in as soon as you can. Delaying on these can turn a moderate repair into a major one. Call us at <%= site.phone %> and we'll help you decide how urgent it is.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/cta') %>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
